    deliberate: it is what lets the test assert an empty tag list without having
    to reason about which fragment of the view the engine happened to keep.

    The @foreach below carries a component with no wire:key, which
    MissingWireKeyInLoop reports whenever the tag list is read normally. It sits
    after the corrupted tag so it cannot be collected before the failure, and it
    is there as a positive control: without it the test's "nothing is reported"
    assertion would hold for a file that has nothing to report either way.
-->
